# Plot {1}{R} (CR 702.170a) is a special action at sorcery timing, and the plotted card is cast for free only as a sorcery on
# a later turn. Turn one: with only Mountain's {R} in the pool the plot is refused (cost). Bolt is cast and, with it on the stack
# and {R}{R} available, the plot is refused (timing); once it resolves the same mana plots Show-Off. The plotted card cannot
# be cast that turn, nor on Bot2's turn two (Bot2's Bolt is on the stack). On turn three it cannot be cast over Bot1's own
# Bolt, then is cast free once the stack is empty: the Moxen are all untapped (exact accounting - nothing was paid) and,
# having haste, it attacks for 1.

